/* 以下 4 个全局捕获监听原挂 document（面板关闭后仍常驻），现改为命名函数挂到 dialog（见 shell()），随面板销毁自动释放。 */
function onToggleEnabledClick(event){const tag=event.target.closest?.('[data-toggle-enabled]');if(tag){togglePromptEnabled(tag.dataset.side,tag.dataset.toggleEnabled);event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();}}
let tavernPresetPickerSide='old';
let tavernPresetPickerData=new Map();
function onTavernPickerClick(event){const target=event.target.closest?.('button');if(!target)return;if(target.dataset.action==='pull-tavern'){tavernPresetPickerSide=target.dataset.side||'old';return;}if(target.dataset.action==='choose-tavern'&&tavernPresetPickerSide==='new'){const preset=tavernPresetPickerData.get(target.dataset.presetName);if(!preset)return;state.new=validate(clone(preset));state.newName=target.dataset.presetName+'.json';state.tavernSource.new=target.dataset.presetName;state.dirty.new=false;state.activeId=null;state.activeSide=null;document.querySelector('[data-tavern-picker]')?.classList.remove('open');hideCompare();rebuildCache();renderAll(false);event.stopImmediatePropagation();}}
const state={old:null,new:null,oldName:'',newName:'',query:{old:'',new:''},filter:{old:'all',new:'all'},activeId:null,activeSide:null,dirty:{old:false,new:false},grouping:{side:null,groupId:null},dragged:{old:new Set(),new:new Set()},modified:{old:new Set(),new:new Set()},history:[],projectId:null,ignoreWhitespace:false,showDiff:false,showSimilarity:false,syncScroll:false,uiTheme:loadUiTheme(),cache:{maps:{old:new Map(),new:new Map()},status:new Map(),ordered:{old:[],new:[]},similarity:new Map(),rows:{old:new Map(),new:new Map()}}};

const DB_NAME='preset-compare-projects',DB_STORE='projects';
state.freeSelect={enabled:false,oldId:null,newId:null};
state.unInjectedCollapsed={old:true,new:true};state.groupCollapsed={};
state.tavernSource={old:null,new:null};
function openProjectDb(){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const request=indexedDB.open(DB_NAME,2);request.onupgradeneeded=()=>{const db=request.result;if(!db.objectStoreNames.contains(DB_STORE))db.createObjectStore(DB_STORE,{keyPath:'id'});if(!db.objectStoreNames.contains('prefs'))db.createObjectStore('prefs',{keyPath:'id'});};request.onsuccess=()=>resolve(request.result);request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error);});}
/* 界面开关状态（自由选择/忽略空白/正文差异）持久化到 IndexedDB 的 prefs 仓库，重开插件后保留。 */
async function saveUiPrefs(){try{const db=await openProjectDb();await new Promise((res,rej)=>{const tx=db.transaction('prefs','readwrite');tx.objectStore('prefs').put({id:'ui',freeSelect:state.freeSelect.enabled,ignoreWhitespace:state.ignoreWhitespace,showDiff:state.showDiff,showSimilarity:state.showSimilarity,syncScroll:state.syncScroll});tx.oncomplete=()=>{db.close();res();};tx.onerror=()=>rej(tx.error);});}catch{}}
async function loadUiPrefs(){try{const db=await openProjectDb();const rec=await new Promise((res,rej)=>{const tx=db.transaction('prefs','readonly'),rq=tx.objectStore('prefs').get('ui');rq.onsuccess=()=>res(rq.result);rq.onerror=()=>rej(rq.error);tx.oncomplete=()=>db.close();});if(rec){state.freeSelect.enabled=!!rec.freeSelect;state.ignoreWhitespace=!!rec.ignoreWhitespace;state.showDiff=!!rec.showDiff;state.showSimilarity=!!rec.showSimilarity;state.syncScroll=!!rec.syncScroll;const fs=document.querySelector('[data-free-select]');if(fs)fs.checked=state.freeSelect.enabled;const iw=document.querySelector('[data-ignore-whitespace]');if(iw)iw.checked=state.ignoreWhitespace;const sm=document.querySelector('[data-show-similarity]');if(sm)sm.checked=state.showSimilarity;const ss=document.querySelector('[data-sync-scroll]');if(ss)ss.checked=state.syncScroll;}}catch{}}
async function dbRequest(mode,callback){const db=await openProjectDb();return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const tx=db.transaction(DB_STORE,mode),store=tx.objectStore(DB_STORE),request=callback(store);request.onsuccess=()=>resolve(request.result);request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error);tx.oncomplete=()=>db.close();});}
async function listProjects(){return(await dbRequest('readonly',store=>store.getAll())).sort((a,b)=>b.updatedAt-a.updatedAt);}
function projectData(name,id){return{id:id||crypto.randomUUID(),name,updatedAt:Date.now(),old:clone(state.old),new:clone(state.new),oldName:state.oldName,newName:state.newName,dragged:{old:[...state.dragged.old],new:[...state.dragged.new]},modified:{old:[...state.modified.old],new:[...state.modified.new]},filter:clone(state.filter)};}
async function saveProject(forceName){let name=forceName||document.querySelector('[data-project-name]')?.value.trim();if(!name)name=prompt('请输入项目名称',state.oldName&&state.newName?state.oldName+' / '+state.newName:'预设编辑项目');if(!name)return;const data=projectData(name,state.projectId);await dbRequest('readwrite',store=>store.put(data));state.projectId=data.id;await refreshProjects();pcmToastr.success('项目已保存');}
async function loadProject(id){const data=await dbRequest('readonly',store=>store.get(id));if(!data)return;state.old=data.old;state.new=data.new;state.oldName=data.oldName||'';state.newName=data.newName||'';state.dragged={old:new Set(data.dragged?.old||[]),new:new Set(data.dragged?.new||[])};state.modified={old:new Set(data.modified?.old||[]),new:new Set(data.modified?.new||[])};state.filter=data.filter||{old:'all',new:'all'};state.projectId=data.id;state.history=[];state.activeId=null;state.activeSide=null;hideCompare();rebuildCache();renderAll(false);await refreshProjects();}
async function deleteProject(id){if(!id||!confirm('确定删除这个已保存项目吗？'))return;await dbRequest('readwrite',store=>store.delete(id));if(state.projectId===id)state.projectId=null;await refreshProjects();}
async function refreshProjects(){const select=document.querySelector('[data-project-select]');if(!select)return;let projects;try{projects=await listProjects();}catch{return;}select.replaceChildren();const empty=el('option','',projects.length?'选择已保存项目':'暂无已保存项目');empty.value='';select.append(empty);for(const project of projects){const option=el('option','',project.name+' · '+new Date(project.updatedAt).toLocaleString());option.value=project.id;option.selected=project.id===state.projectId;select.append(option);}const current=projects.find(x=>x.id===state.projectId),name=document.querySelector('[data-project-name]');if(name&&current)name.value=current.name;}
function pushUndo(action){state.history.push(action);if(state.history.length>50)state.history.shift();updateUndoButton();}
function updateUndoButton(){const button=document.querySelector('[data-action=undo]');if(button)button.disabled=!state.history.length;}
function undoLast(){const action=state.history.pop();if(!action)return;const side=action.side,preset=state[side];if(action.type==='edit'){const index=preset.prompts.findIndex(p=>p.identifier===action.id);if(index>=0)preset.prompts[index]=action.before;state.modified[side]=new Set(action.modifiedBefore);}else if(action.type==='move'){preset.prompts=action.promptOrder.map(id=>action.prompts.get(id)).filter(Boolean);preset.prompt_order=clone(action.promptOrderData);preset.extensions=clone(action.extensionsBefore);state.dragged[side]=new Set(action.draggedBefore);}state.dirty[side]=true;state.activeId=null;hideCompare();rebuildCache();renderAll();updateUndoButton();}

const clone=value=>structuredClone(value);
const ALL_TRIGGERS=['continue','impersonate','normal','quiet','regenerate','swipe'];
const normalizeTrigger=value=>{if(!Array.isArray(value))return[];const sorted=[...value].sort();return sorted.length===ALL_TRIGGERS.length&&ALL_TRIGGERS.every((t,i)=>sorted[i]===t)?[]:sorted;};
const normalizeForCompare=(value,loose)=>{if(Array.isArray(value))return value.map(item=>normalizeForCompare(item,loose));if(value&&typeof value==='object'){const keys=Object.keys(value);if(!keys.includes('injection_trigger'))keys.push('injection_trigger');return Object.fromEntries(keys.sort().map(key=>[key,key==='injection_trigger'?normalizeTrigger(value[key]):normalizeForCompare(value[key],loose)]));}return loose&&typeof value==='string'?value.replace(/\s+/g,''):value;};
const equal=(a,b)=>JSON.stringify(normalizeForCompare(a,state.ignoreWhitespace))===JSON.stringify(normalizeForCompare(b,state.ignoreWhitespace));
function el(tag,cls,text){const n=document.createElement(tag);if(cls)n.className=cls;if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=String(text);return n;}
function btn(text,action,cls,side){const n=el('button','menu_button '+(cls||''),text);n.type='button';n.dataset.action=action;if(side)n.dataset.side=side;return n;}
/* 轻量提示：替代酒馆 toastr（其 CSS 动画/全局容器在移动端较卡），在对话框底部短暂浮现后自动消失。 */
let pcmToastBox=null;
function pcmToast(text,type='info',title){let box=pcmToastBox;if(!box||!box.isConnected)box=pcmToastBox=el('div','pcm-toastbox');const host=document.getElementById(APP_ID+'-dialog')||document.body;if(box.parentNode!==host)host.append(box);const item=el('div','pcm-toast pcm-toast-'+type,(title?title+'：':'')+text);box.append(item);requestAnimationFrame(()=>item.classList.add('in'));const ms=type==='error'?6000:3000;setTimeout(()=>{item.classList.remove('in');setTimeout(()=>item.remove(),260);},ms);}
const pcmToastr={success:(t,ti)=>pcmToast(t,'success',ti),info:(t,ti)=>pcmToast(t,'info',ti),warning:(t,ti)=>pcmToast(t,'warning',ti),error:(t,ti)=>pcmToast(t,'error',ti)};
function validate(data){if(!data||!Array.isArray(data.prompts))throw new Error('不是有效的 SillyTavern OpenAI 预设：缺少 prompts 数组。');const ids=new Set();for(const p of data.prompts){if(!p||typeof p.identifier!=='string'||!p.identifier)throw new Error('存在没有 identifier 的条目。');if(ids.has(p.identifier))throw new Error('条目 ID 重复：'+p.identifier);ids.add(p.identifier);}return data;}
function rebuildCache(){for(const side of ['old','new']){const preset=state[side],map=new Map((preset?.prompts||[]).map(p=>[p.identifier,p]));state.cache.maps[side]=map;const seen=new Set(),out=[],orderEntry=promptOrderEntry(preset),orderEntries=Array.isArray(orderEntry?.order)?orderEntry.order:[];for(const item of orderEntries){const id=typeof item==='string'?item:item?.identifier,p=map.get(id);if(p&&!seen.has(id)){seen.add(id);out.push(p);}}for(const p of preset?.prompts||[])if(!seen.has(p.identifier)){seen.add(p.identifier);out.push(p);}state.cache.ordered[side]=out;}const status=new Map(),ids=new Set([...state.cache.maps.old.keys(),...state.cache.maps.new.keys()]);for(const id of ids){const o=state.cache.maps.old.get(id),n=state.cache.maps.new.get(id);status.set(id,o&&!n?'removed':!o&&n?'added':o&&n&&!equal(withoutEnabled(o),withoutEnabled(n))?'changed':'same');}state.cache.status=status;state.cache.similarity.clear();}
